      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not convinced that blocking interfaces in a single-threaded environment are going to work. I\u0027m pretty sure you\u0027re either going to need a scheduler with multiple threads, or something async or async-like with a main loop polling everything.",
      "revId": "bc9a8646864e03d3500016348044aa0be5f9a386",
